# For Reference: Newborn Screening

@body

- Reference: not covered in lecture

| Group | Examples |
| --- | --- |
| Metabolism | PKU, methylmalonic acidemia, MSUD, tyrosinemia, citrullinemia, MCAD deficiency |
| Hemoglobin | Sickle cell disease, hemoglobin SC disease, beta thalassemia |
| Hormones | Congenital hypothyroidism, congenital adrenal hyperplasia |
| Other | Galactosemia, biotinidase deficiency, cystic fibrosis, SCID, Pompe disease, MPS I, X-linked adrenoleukodystrophy, spinal muscular atrophy |

Panels vary by screening program.

